      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/2015317610829680781",
      "text": "[7:50AM] #Mile12\n#Ketu\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nVehicular movement from Odo Ogun through Ajegunle and Thomas is good at the moment while approaching Irawo is slightly busy  but moving due to pedestrians crossing and early morning rush.\n\nPushing forward to Weigh bridge down to  Owode Onirin, Mile12 and en route Ketu is still appreciable as well.\n\nNavigating under Mile 12 bridge inward Ajelogo is looking good for now.\n\nReturn journey from Iyana School,kosofe down to Mile 12 is appreciable.\n\nKetu back to Kosofe is good. \nAscending and descending Mile 12 bridge inward Owode Elede, Owode Onirin, Weigh bridge, Idera, Irawo Thomas,  Ajegunle down to Odo Ogun is very encouraging.\n#FollowLASTMA",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
